    <item>
      <headword id="idp1313464">tothan</headword>
      <description>we have this word for a place-name in Scalpay, thus: An Tobhan [sic] Liath.</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <headword id="idp1314544">tòthan</headword>
      <description>we have also: air mullaich an tòthain. Likely, it’s the same word [as tothan q.v.], but at one instance it’s spoken unaccented.</description>
    </item>
    <item>
